 385:Generated_Source\PSoC5/isr_SyncIn.c **** *
 386:Generated_Source\PSoC5/isr_SyncIn.c **** * Summary:
 387:Generated_Source\PSoC5/isr_SyncIn.c **** *   Clears a pending interrupt in the interrupt controller.
 388:Generated_Source\PSoC5/isr_SyncIn.c **** *
 389:Generated_Source\PSoC5/isr_SyncIn.c **** *   Note Some interrupt sources are clear-on-read and require the block 
 390:Generated_Source\PSoC5/isr_SyncIn.c **** *   interrupt/status register to be read/cleared with the appropriate block API 
ARM GAS  C:\Users\elias\AppData\Local\Temp\cc0djEz2.s 			page 56


